---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Security contact · Lecturn">
<article class="lecturn-notice"><h1>Security contact</h1><p>Report suspected vulnerabilities in the Lecturn deployment privately to <a href="mailto:accounts@cloudgatherer.net">accounts@cloudgatherer.net</a>. Include the affected component and enough detail to reproduce the issue without sending passwords, API keys, or private project content.</p><p>Lecturn is operated by Cloud Gatherer Labs LLC. This contact applies to Lecturn's hosted services and applications.</p></article>
</Layout>
<style>.lecturn-notice {max-width:740px;margin:72px auto;padding:0 24px 80px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7}.lecturn-notice h1,.lecturn-notice h2{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:400}.lecturn-notice h1{font-size:46px}.lecturn-notice h2{font-size:26px;margin-top:36px}.lecturn-notice p{margin-top:18px}.lecturn-notice a{color:var(--accent)}</style>
